{
  "name": "cortico-world-casino",
  "version": "1.0.5",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "你的 AI 到底会不会打牌?装上就知道了。桌上备有多种牌类游戏,可与 AI 本地对桌,也能启用星邮跨机器联机对战:庄家每手轮换、面板实时观战、断线自动补发。筹码是游戏内数字,破产有救济金,牌桌还会不断上新。玩法与配置详见 [项目 README](https://github.com/Flerish/cortico-world-casino)。如有任何问题请加群1135333756反馈,您的反馈是我进步的方向。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Flerish/cortico-world-casino#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Flerish/cortico-world-casino.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Flerish/cortico-world-casino/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "cortico-world",
    "cortico",
    "blackjack",
    "oldmaid",
    "cards",
    "game",
    "local"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.28.6",
  "main": "./src/index.ts",
  "cortico": {
    "kind": "world",
    "api": 6,
    "displayName": "月下牌桌",
    "icon": "assets/icon.png",
    "webUiClient": "dist/webui.js",
    "locales": {
      "en": {
        "displayName": "Moonlit Table",
        "description": "Card games on a green-felt table in your computer — vs your AI locally, or online via Starpost: rotating dealer, spectate, self-healing. In-game chips, relief funds, more games soon. [README](https://github.com/Flerish/cortico-world-casino) Grp 1135333756"
      }
    },
    "tags": [
      "game",
      "experimental"
    ],
    "describe": "describe.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "dist",
    "scripts",
    "assets",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "describe.json"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:webui": "node scripts/build-webui.mjs",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit && tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.webui.json"
